    "reviews": "\u201cDragon Ball Z, Cartoon Network and Mortal Kombat in equal measure...a refined, fun multiplayer experience.\u201d<br>Fingerguns<br><br>\u201cSuperpowered Smash Bros - A fantastically frantic fighter that barely gives you time to think.\u201d<br>Nintendo Life<br><br>\u201cThe interactivity of Smash maps, the imaginative deaths of Crash Bandicoot and the graphic style of Mucha Lucha...a title to recommend to everyone.\u201d<br>Gamempire<br>",
